# Global Windsurf / Cascade Guardrails

You are assisting on the ai_social_media_automation workspace. To maintain data isolation and prevent context bloating, you must respect the specialized workspace boundaries mapped inside the project.

## 🚨 Critical Guardrails (UNCONDITIONAL)
- **Multi-Tenancy:** Every database read, write, update, and delete operation MUST be explicitly filtered and scoped by `organizationId`. Never run raw or unscoped collection queries.
- **Asynchronous Tasking:** Never execute long-running AI generation, processing, or multi-platform posting loops inside synchronous Next.js API Route Handlers. Offload them via BullMQ workers immediately.

